-## Subtopics
-
-### Logarithmic Soft Shadows
-Uses $\log(t \cdot w + 1.0)$ in the denominator instead of linear $t$ to prevent artifacts when lights are near geometry [S6, unofficial]. Choose when lights are dynamic or close to surfaces.
-
-### Scale-Based Penumbra
-Uses a `scale` parameter directly in `min(shadow, scale * d/t)` to control penumbra width visually [S8, unofficial]. Choose for artistic control over shadow softness independent of physical light size.
